   "i": 97,
   "start": 515.663,
   "end": 520.747,
   "voice_at": 515.743,
   "vd": 4.704
  },
  {
   "text": "At Real Madrid alone, nine years, and four hundred and fifty goals in four hundred and thirty-eight games.",
