   "sfx": null,
   "i": 101,
   "start": 540.751,
   "end": 545.571,
   "voice_at": 540.831,
   "vd": 4.44
  },
  {
   "text": "In a recent Vogue interview, he said: 'This is probably my last year of football, and I want to leave a spectacular legacy.'",
